From: YanIanZ <iwayanbagusaryadarma@student.telkomuniversity.ac.id>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 06:36:24 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] SourbyCraft - hold a stop requested during startup until
 startup ends

A plugin that calls Bukkit.shutdown() from onEnable runs on the server
thread inside DedicatedServer#initServer. The region-threading stop
path started the region shutdown thread at once, which disabled
plugins, closed every world's chunk storage, saved and exited while the
server thread kept running the rest of startup: its startup save then
flushed into closed region files (ClosedChannelException), the region
scheduler was started and "Done (" was logged after "Stopping server",
or System.exit cut the server thread off in the middle of startup.

stopServer now asks StartupStopGate first: a stop requested by the
server thread before startup has ended is only marked. Startup goes on
as on Paper, where halt only clears the running flag (remaining plugins
enable, worlds stay loaded); initServer then skips the query/rcon
listeners, the startup save and the started notification, and
runServer logs StartupStopGate.ABANDONED_MESSAGE instead of starting the
region scheduler and logging "Done (", and runs the stop, which saves
every world once with its storage open. If startup throws after such a
request, the held stop still runs. Stops from any other thread keep the
old behaviour; a normal startup is unchanged.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/MinecraftServer.java b/net/minecraft/server/MinecraftServer.java
index a32d4c59630f8c0b22201c6d9d831249a1ce82ba..25d702c1f2c4d049f66730ffdbde7d4066aa89fc 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/MinecraftServer.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/MinecraftServer.java
@@ -1076,7 +1076,10 @@ public abstract class MinecraftServer extends ReentrantBlockableEventLoop<TickTa
         new io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.RegionShutdownThread("Region shutdown thread").start();
     }
 
+    public final dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.startup.StartupStopGate startupStopGate = new dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.startup.StartupStopGate(); // SourbyCraft - stop requested during startup
+
     public void stopServer() {
+        if (this.startupStopGate.holdIfStarting(Thread.currentThread() == this.serverThread)) return; // SourbyCraft - stop requested during startup: held until startup ends on this thread
         // halt scheduler
         // don't wait, we may be on a scheduler thread
         io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.TickRegions.getScheduler().halt(false, 0L);
@@ -1332,6 +1335,13 @@ public abstract class MinecraftServer extends ReentrantBlockableEventLoop<TickTa
             if (!this.initServer()) {
                 throw new IllegalStateException("Failed to initialize server");
             }
+            // SourbyCraft start - stop requested during startup
+            if (this.startupStopGate.finishStartup()) {
+                LOGGER.info(dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.startup.StartupStopGate.ABANDONED_MESSAGE);
+                this.stopServer();
+                return;
+            }
+            // SourbyCraft end - stop requested during startup
 
             this.nextTickTimeNanos = Util.getNanos();
             this.initTickSchedule(); // Paper - improve tick loop
@@ -1439,6 +1449,7 @@ public abstract class MinecraftServer extends ReentrantBlockableEventLoop<TickTa
             }
 
             this.onServerCrash(report);
+            if (this.startupStopGate.finishStartup()) this.stopServer(); // SourbyCraft - stop requested during startup: startup failed afterwards, still run the held stop
         } if (false) { // Canvas - region threading
             try {
                 this.stopped = true;
diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/dedicated/DedicatedServer.java b/net/minecraft/server/dedicated/DedicatedServer.java
index b2b161cc561fc871f253aea09f91010c07b9516a..afde7a601783ba1206973090e802a78b51e50a31 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/dedicated/DedicatedServer.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/dedicated/DedicatedServer.java
@@ -366,6 +366,8 @@ public class DedicatedServer extends MinecraftServer implements ServerInterface
             this.getAllLevels().forEach(l -> l.getGameRules().set(GameRules.SHOW_ADVANCEMENT_MESSAGES, properties.announcePlayerAchievements, this.overworld())); // Paper - per-world game rules
         }
 
+        if (this.startupStopGate.stopHeld()) return true; // SourbyCraft - stop requested during startup: no listeners, no startup save; the stop saves once
+
         if (properties.enableQuery) {
             LOGGER.info("Starting GS4 status listener");
             this.queryThreadGs4 = QueryThreadGs4.create(this);
